#: editorrecurrence.cpp:322
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "day"
msgstr "Dag"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:328
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Sets a weekday and specific week in the month on which this event or to-do "
"should recur"
msgstr ""
"Leggt en Wekendag un de Week vun den Maand fast, för den de Opgaav oder dat "
"Begeefnis jümmers inplaant warrt."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:420
msgctxt "@option:radio part before XXX of 'Recur on day XXX of month YYY'"
msgid "&Recur on day "
msgstr "Wedde&rhalen op Dag "

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:425
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Sets a specific day in a specific month on which this event or to-do should "
"recur."
msgstr ""
"Leggt Maand un Dag fast, för den de Opgaav oder dat Begeefnis jümmers "
"inplaant warrt."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:437
msgctxt "@label part between XXX and YYY of 'Recur on day XXX of month YYY'"
msgid " &of "
msgstr " &in'n "

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:453
msgctxt "@option:radio Part before XXX in 'Recur on NNN. WEEKDAY of MONTH'"
msgid "&On the"
msgstr "&An den"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:458
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Sets a specific day in a specific week of a specific month on which this "
"event or to-do should recur."
msgstr ""
"Leggt Maand, Week un Wekendag fast, för den de Opgaav oder dat Begeefnis "
"jümmers inplaant warrt."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:471
msgctxt ""
"@label part between WEEKDAY and MONTH in 'Recur on NNN. WEEKDAY of MONTH'"
msgid " o&f "
msgstr " i&n'n "

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:485
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Recur on &day #"
msgstr "Wedderhalen an &Dag Nr."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:488
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Sets a specific day within the year on which this event or to-do should "
"recur."
msgstr ""
"Leggt en Dag in't Johr fast, för den de Opgaav oder dat Begeefnis inplaant "
"warrt."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:502
msgctxt "@label part after NNN of 'Recur on day #NNN of the year'"
msgid " of the &year"
msgstr " in't &Johr "

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:594
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "E&xceptions"
msgstr "&Utnahmen"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:602
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"A date that should be considered an exception to the recurrence rules for "
"this event or to-do."
msgstr ""
"En Datum, dat en Utnahm to de Wedderhaal-Regeln vun de Opgaav oder dat "
"Begeefnis is."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:608
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "&Tofögen"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:611
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Add this date as an exception to the recurrence rules for this event or to-"
"do."
msgstr ""
"Dit Datum as en Utnahm to de Wedderhaal-Regeln vun de Opgaav oder dat "
"Begeefnis tofögen"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:616
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "&Change"
msgstr "Ä&nnern"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:619
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid "Replace the currently selected date with this date."
msgstr "För dat opstunns utsöchte Datum dit Datum insetten"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:623
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "&Delete"
msgstr "&Wegdoon"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:626
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Delete the currently selected date from the list of dates that should be "
"considered exceptions to the recurrence rules for this event or to-do."
msgstr ""
"Dat opstunns utsöchte Datum vun de List mit Utnahmen to de Wedderhaal-Regeln "
"vun de Opgaav oder dat Begeefnis wegdoon"

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:634
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Displays current dates that are being considered exceptions to the "
"recurrence rules for this event or to-do."
msgstr ""
"Wiest de List mit Utnahmen to de Wedderhaal-Regeln vun de Opgaav oder dat "
"Begeefnis."

#: editorrecurrence.cpp:702
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Edit Exceptions"
msgstr "Utnahmen bewerken"

#. i18n: file: incidenceeditor-ng/incidencerecurrenceeditor.ui:805
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: editorrecurrence.cpp:726 rc.cpp:845
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Recurrence Range"
msgstr "Wedderhaal-Tietrebeet"

#. i18n: file: incidenceeditor-ng/incidencerecurrenceeditor.ui:802
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: editorrecurrence.cpp:728 rc.cpp:842
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Sets a range for which these recurrence rules will apply to this event or to-"
"do."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, binnen welk Tietrebeet de Wedderhaal-Regeln vun de Opgaav oder "
"dat Begeefnis gellt."

